

  deviceAuthHandshake SEC-3
    ✔ observed fingerprint != AuthNonce self-report => fail-closed
    ✔ prefetchedNonce skips a second GetAuthNonce

  device auth rpc failure classification (ELR-6)
    ✔ UNAVAILABLE pin text is pin_mismatch and beats the status code
    ✔ UNAVAILABLE without a certificate reason stays transport_failed
    ✔ OpenSSL verify failure is pin_mismatch
    ✔ Connect UNAUTHENTICATED is grant_revoked and GetAuthNonce UNAUTHENTICATED is not
    ✔ a plain UNAUTHENTICATED string is not grant_revoked
    ✔ deadline and a plain error are engine_not_serving, not transport_failed
    ✔ runDeviceAuthHandshake classifies a thrown GetAuthNonce and Connect

